Virtual Private Network
    - Establishes secure connection between an on-premise network, remote offices. client devices, and provider's global network 
    - Extend through an encrypted VPN tunnel in the public internet from the cloud provider network to your own enterprise network

Private direct connection
    = Amazon Web Services (Direct Connect Gateway)
    - Microsoft Azure (Azure Express Route)

    - Extends on-premise data center into the provider's network to directly connect to the virtual private cloud network
    - Bypasses internet directly

Difference?
    - Private direct connection is faster speeds and better performance, but also more expensive

